{"title":"2007 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b765be342169c80934b17fd4c94cbfbab9b157ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^5 - 5^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/9/2b9781bd5b6471b5fbea4af44f7e06f22acd1fe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ -3 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ -7 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 3 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"432\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/d/a7d80c3cb9c694d6adda90dcd178a5dc631b6778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^5 - 5^2 = 32 - 5^2 = 32 - 25 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"300\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Pascal\" title=